# AI / Human Collaboration

- Every change requires a GitHub issue (task/bug/feature) and a dedicated branch.
- PR must use the mandatory template (`.github/pull_request_template.md`).
- CI must pass (rust / dependency-policy / merge-guard).
- Pre-commit checks (format / deny / check) enforced via `.github/hooks/pre-commit`. Install with `cp .github/hooks/pre-commit .git/hooks/pre-commit && chmod +x .git/hooks/pre-commit`. Never commit with failing checks.
- Agent actions tracked: commit tags `[agent:<harness>]`, PR body agent fields, audit artifacts.
- Never push directly to `main`; never merge without authorization. Self-approval permitted for solo maintainer.
- Recovery: see `docs/recovery.md`; revert workflow available.
